111"><td data-start="5963" data-end="6011" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="5965" data-end="6010">aula03_18_checklist-referencia-espacial.png</code></td><td data-start="6011" data-end="6111" data-col-size="lg">Checklist técnico para conferência de referência espacial antes de analisar ou publicar um mapa.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copiar tabela" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="6113" data-end="6116">
<h1 data-section-id="1ni7d0q" data-start="6118" data-end="6146">Minha recomendação prática</h1>
<p data-start="6148" data-end="6182">Eu criaria primeiro estas imagens:</p>
<ol data-start="6184" data-end="6423">
<li data-section-id="eoba4p" data-start="6184" data-end="6195">
<p data-start="6187" data-end="6195"><strong data-start="6187" data-end="6195">Capa</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bljelj" data-start="6196" data-end="6228">
