ass="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%)"><div class="max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap">É para o html chat, índex </div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Suas ações de mensagem" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copiar mensagem" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Editar mensagem" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="1907c293-04c3-47b9-8cce-c5bb32fc3072" data-testid="conversation-turn-12" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">O ChatGPT disse:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)">Pensou por alguns segundos<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="074772be-25bd-4864-aaed-4dba46e0a805" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="174">Ahhh, entendi agora, Dani 😅<br data-start="28" data-end="31">
Você quer os <strong data-start="44" data-end="97">nomes dos PNG já pensando no <code data-start="75" data-end="87">index.html</code> da aula</strong>, ou seja: nomes organizados para chamar direto no HTML da página da Aula 03.</p>
<p data-start="176" data-end="197">Então eu faria assim:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="199" data-end="945"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>onepage-Geotatica/</span><br><span>└── aula 03/</span><br><span>    ├── index.html</span><br><span>    └── img/</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_01_capa-sistemas-coordenadas-sig.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_02_superficies-referencia.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_03_datum-horizontal-vertical.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_04_sirgas-2000-brasil.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_05_coordenadas-geograficas.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_06_latitude-longitude.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_07_coordenadas-geograficas-projetadas.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_08_projecoes-cartograficas.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_09_tipos-projecoes.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_10_projecoes-preservam.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_11_utm-fusos.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_12_estrutura-utm.png</span><br><span>        ├── aula03_13_fusos-utm-brasil.png</span><br><span>        └── aula03_14_checklist-referencia-espacial.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="947" data-end="1161">Como o conteúdo do slide trata justamente de datum, SIRGAS 2000, coordenadas geográficas, projeções, UTM e checklist técnico, essa sequência acompanha bem a lógica do material. <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_4qs_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Sistemas_informacoes_Geograficas</p></button></span></p>
<hr data-start="1163" data-end="1166">
<h1 data-section-id="l1lnuw" data-start="1168" data-end="1214"><span role="text">Sugestão de nomes finais para o <code data-start="1202" data-end="1214">index.html</code></span></h1>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1216" data-end="2233" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1216" data-end="1247"><tr data-start="1216" data-end="1247"><th data-start="1216" data-end="1232" data-col-size="sm" class="">Seção da aula</th><th data-start="1232" data-end="1247" data-col-size="md" class="">Nome do PNG</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1258" data-end="2233"><tr data-start="1258" data-end="1326"><td data-start="1258" data-end="1273" data-col-size="sm">Capa da aula</td><td data-start="1273" data-end="1326" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1275" data-end="1324">img/aula03_01_capa-sistemas-coordenadas-sig.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1327" data-end="1401"><td data-start="1327" data-end="1355" data-col-size="sm">Superfícies de referência</td><td data-start="1355" data-end="1401" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1357" data-end="1399">img/aula03_02_superficies-referencia.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1402" data-end="1481"><td data-start="1402" data-end="1432" data-col-size="sm">Datum horizontal e vertical</td><td data-start="1432" data-end="1481" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1434" data-end="1479">img/aula03_03_datum-horizontal-vertical.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1482" data-end="1548"><td data-start="1482" data-end="1506" data-col-size="sm">SIRGAS 2000 no Brasil</td><td data-start="1506" data-end="1548" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1508" data-end="1546">img/aula03_04_sirgas-2000-brasil.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1549" data-end="1622"><td data-start="1549" data-end="1575" data-col-size="sm">Coordenadas geográficas</td><td data-start="1575" data-end="1622" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1577" data-end="1620">img/aula03_05_coordenadas-geograficas.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1623" data-end="1688"><td data-start="1623" data-end="1646" data-col-size="sm">Latitude e longitude</td><td data-start="1646" data-end="1688" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1648" data-end="1686">img/aula03_06_latitude-longitude.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1689" data-end="1786"><td data-start="1689" data-end="1728" data-col-size="sm">Coordenadas geográficas x projetadas</td><td data-start="1728" data-end="1786" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1730" data-end="1784">img/aula03_07_coordenadas-geograficas-projetadas.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1787" data-end="1860"><td data-start="1787" data-end="1813" data-col-size="sm">Projeções cartográficas</td><td data-start="1813" data-end="1860" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1815" data-end="1858">img/aula03_08_projecoes-cartograficas.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1861" data-end="1921"><td data-start="1861" data-end="1882" data-col-size="sm">Tipos de projeções</td><td data-start="1882" data-end="1921" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1884" data-end="1919">img/aula03_09_tipos-projecoes.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1922" data-end="1996"><td data-start="1922" data-end="1953" data-col-size="sm">O que as projeções preservam</td><td data-start="1953" data-end="1996" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1955" data-end="1994">img/aula03_10_projecoes-preservam.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1997" data-end="2044"><td data-start="1997" data-end="2011" data-col-size="sm">UTM e fusos</td><td data-start="2011" data-end="2044" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="2013" data-end="2042">img/aula03_11_utm-fusos.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="2045" data-end="2098"><td data-start="2045" data-end="2061" data-col-size="sm">Estrutura UTM</td><td data-start="2061" data-end="2098" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="2063" data-end="2096">img/aula03_12_estrutura-utm.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="2099" data-end="2161"><td data-start="2099" data-end="2121" data-col-size="sm">Fusos UTM no Brasil</td><td data-start="2121" data-end="2161" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="2123" data-end="2159">img/aula03_13_fusos-utm-brasil.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="2162" data-end="2233"><td data-start="2162" data-end="2180" data-col-size="sm">Checklist final</td><td data-start="2180" data-end="2233" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="2182" data-end="2231">img/aula03_14_checklist-referencia-espacial.png</code></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copiar tabela" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="2235" data-end="2238">
<h1 data-section-id="1nxn1vk" data-start="2240" data-end="2261">Como chamar no HTML</h1>
<p data-start="2263" data-end="2340">No <code data-start="2266" data-end="2278">index.html</code>, se a pasta <code data-start="2291" data-end="2296">img</code> estiver dentro da pasta da aula, use assim:</p>
