<p data-start="33" data-end="452">Para o HTML, faz sentido <strong data-start="58" data-end="90">reduzir a quantidade de PNGs</strong> e juntar temas que são naturalmente próximos. Assim a aula fica mais leve de montar, com menos chamadas no <code data-start="198" data-end="210">index.html</code>, e você evita ficar com imagem demais para um conteúdo que já é sequencial. O slide que você enviou organiza bem esses blocos: superfícies de referência, datum, SIRGAS 2000, coordenadas, projeções e UTM. <span class="relative inline-flex items-center select-none" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_4sp_" data-state="closed"><button type="button" class="ms-1 relative flex h-[25px] select-none items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-xl px-2 text-[10px] leading-[13px] corner-superellipse/1.1 text-token-text-secondary! hover:text-token-text-primary! hover:bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-token-main-surface-secondary dark:hover:bg-token-bg-secondary bg-[#f4f4f4] "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-[16px] w-[16px] object-contain text-token-text-primary! flex-none icon-sm"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#554074" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><p class="not-prose mt-0! mb-0! flex-auto truncate">Sistemas_informacoes_Geograficas</p></button></span></p>
<h2 data-section-id="1tate4p" data-start="454" data-end="471">Minha sugestão</h2>
<p data-start="473" data-end="528">Em vez de <strong data-start="483" data-end="497">14 imagens</strong>, eu reduziria para <strong data-start="517" data-end="527">8 ou 9</strong>.</p>
<h1 data-section-id="k68flu" data-start="530" data-end="582">Opção recomendada, mais equilibrada, com 9 imagens</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="8yx04q" data-start="584" data-end="598">Lista final</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="600" data-end="1045"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>img/aula03_01_fluxo-referencia-espacial.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_02_superficies-referencia-e-datum.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_03_sirgas-2000-brasil.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_04_coordenadas-geograficas-e-latitude-longitude.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_05_coordenadas-geograficas-e-projetadas.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_06_projecoes-cartograficas-tipos-e-propriedades.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_07_utm-fusos-e-estrutura.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_08_fusos-utm-brasil.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_09_checklist-referencia-espacial.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1047" data-end="1050">
<h1 data-section-id="191i0w7" data-start="1052" data-end="1071">O que foi juntado</h1>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1073" data-end="1662" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1073" data-end="1091"><tr data-start="1073" data-end="1091"><th data-start="1073" data-end="1081" data-col-size="lg" class="">Antes</th><th data-start="1081" data-end="1091" data-col-size="md" class="">Depois</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1102" data-end="1662"><tr data-start="1102" data-end="1237"><td data-start="1102" data-end="1187" data-col-size="lg"><code data-start="1104" data-end="1142">aula03_02_superficies-referencia.png</code> + <code data-start="1145" data-end="1186">aula03_03_datum-horizontal-vertical.png</code></td><td data-start="1187" data-end="1237" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1189" data-end="1235">aula03_02_superficies-referencia-e-datum.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1238" data-end="1381"><td data-start="1238" data-end="1317" data-col-size="lg"><code data-start="1240" data-end="1279">aula03_05_coordenadas-geograficas.png</code> + <code data-start="1282" data-end="1316">aula03_06_latitude-longitude.png</code></td><td data-start="1317" data-end="1381" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1319" data-end="1379">aula03_04_coordenadas-geograficas-e-latitude-longitude.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1382" data-end="1560"><td data-start="1382" data-end="1496" data-col-size="lg"><code data-start="1384" data-end="1423">aula03_08_projecoes-cartograficas.png</code> + <code data-start="1426" data-end="1457">aula03_09_tipos-projecoes.png</code> + <code data-start="1460" data-end="1495">aula03_10_projecoes-preservam.png</code></td><td data-start="1496" data-end="1560" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1498" data-end="1558">aula03_06_projecoes-cartograficas-tipos-e-propriedades.png</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1561" data-end="1662"><td data-start="1561" data-end="1621" data-col-size="lg"><code data-start="1563" data-end="1588">aula03_11_utm-fusos.png</code> + <code data-start="1591" data-end="1620">aula03_12_estrutura-utm.png</code></td><td data-start="1621" data-end="1662" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1623" data-end="1660">aula03_07_utm-fusos-e-estrutura.png</code></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7969px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copiar tabela" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="1664" data-end="1667">
<h1 data-section-id="slmigu" data-start="1669" data-end="1704">Por que essa divisão funciona bem</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="cdonp4" data-start="1706" data-end="1753"><span role="text">1. <code data-start="1712" data-end="1753">aula03_01_fluxo-referencia-espacial.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="1754" data-end="1776">Use no começo da aula.</p>
<p data-start="1778" data-end="1886"><strong data-start="1778" data-end="1789">Função:</strong> abrir a lógica da aula.<br data-start="1813" data-end="1816">
Exemplo visual: dado → referência espacial → medição → análise → mapa.</p>
<hr data-start="1888" data-end="1891">
<h2 data-section-id="1tp43n" data-start="1893" data-end="1945"><span role="text">2. <code data-start="1899" data-end="1945">aula03_02_superficies-referencia-e-datum.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="1946" data-end="1989">Junta dois temas que conversam diretamente.</p>
<p data-start="1991" data-end="2019"><strong data-start="1991" data-end="2019">Bloco interno da imagem:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2020" data-end="2126">
<li data-section-id="7l5r1x" data-start="2020" data-end="2072">
<p data-start="2022" data-end="2072">lado 1: geoide, elipsoide e superfície topográfica</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h73wly" data-start="2073" data-end="2126">
<p data-start="2075" data-end="2126">lado 2: datum horizontal/geodésico e datum vertical</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2128" data-end="2167">Essa junção faz muito sentido didático.</p>
<hr data-start="2169" data-end="2172">
<h2 data-section-id="j9epny" data-start="2174" data-end="2214"><span role="text">3. <code data-start="2180" data-end="2214">aula03_03_sirgas-2000-brasil.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="2215" data-end="2236">Eu manteria separado.</p>
<p data-start="2238" data-end="2310"><strong data-start="2238" data-end="2249">Motivo:</strong> no contexto brasileiro, SIRGAS 2000 merece destaque próprio.</p>
<hr data-start="2312" data-end="2315">
<h2 data-section-id="4qg5im" data-start="2317" data-end="2383"><span role="text">4. <code data-start="2323" data-end="2383">aula03_04_coordenadas-geograficas-e-latitude-longitude.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="2384" data-end="2429">Aqui dá para juntar tudo em um único esquema.</p>
<p data-start="2431" data-end="2449"><strong data-start="2431" data-end="2449">Bloco interno:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2450" data-end="2543">
<li data-section-id="8n0htf" data-start="2450" data-end="2484">
<p data-start="2452" data-end="2484">globo com paralelos e meridianos</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mweymy" data-start="2485" data-end="2506">
<p data-start="2487" data-end="2506">Equador e Greenwich</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="stg316" data-start="2507" data-end="2543">
<p data-start="2509" data-end="2543">destaque para latitude e longitude</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2545" data-end="2548">
<h2 data-section-id="x807ht" data-start="2550" data-end="2608"><span role="text">5. <code data-start="2556" data-end="2608">aula03_05_coordenadas-geograficas-e-projetadas.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="2609" data-end="2656">Essa imagem funciona muito bem como comparação.</p>
<p data-start="2658" data-end="2676"><strong data-start="2658" data-end="2676">Bloco interno:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2677" data-end="2775">
<li data-section-id="trvoum" data-start="2677" data-end="2726">
<p data-start="2679" data-end="2726">lado esquerdo: coordenadas geográficas em graus</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="k3xtda" data-start="2727" data-end="2775">
<p data-start="2729" data-end="2775">lado direito: coordenadas projetadas em metros</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2777" data-end="2780">
<h2 data-section-id="hj9q3z" data-start="2782" data-end="2848"><span role="text">6. <code data-start="2788" data-end="2848">aula03_06_projecoes-cartograficas-tipos-e-propriedades.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="2849" data-end="2913">Aqui você pode fazer uma imagem mais rica, dividida em 3 partes.</p>
<p data-start="2915" data-end="2942"><strong data-start="2915" data-end="2942">Sugestão de composição:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2943" data-end="3119">
<li data-section-id="141ug37" data-start="2943" data-end="2987">
<p data-start="2945" data-end="2987">faixa superior: conceito geral de projeção</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="pz977e" data-start="2988" data-end="3052">
<p data-start="2990" data-end="3052">faixa central: cilíndrica, cônica, azimutal e pseudocilíndrica</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9vggz0" data-start="3053" data-end="3119">
<p data-start="3055" data-end="3119">faixa inferior: o que preservam, forma, área, distância, direção</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3121" data-end="3152">Essa é uma das melhores fusões.</p>
<hr data-start="3154" data-end="3157">
<h2 data-section-id="cnn0zd" data-start="3159" data-end="3202"><span role="text">7. <code data-start="3165" data-end="3202">aula03_07_utm-fusos-e-estrutura.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="3203" data-end="3222">Também combina bem.</p>
<p data-start="3224" data-end="3242"><strong data-start="3224" data-end="3242">Bloco interno:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="3243" data-end="3354">
<li data-section-id="jbe0qe" data-start="3243" data-end="3268">
<p data-start="3245" data-end="3268">Terra dividida em fusos</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1sv0fv3" data-start="3269" data-end="3299">
<p data-start="3271" data-end="3299">esquema de meridiano central</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="le4pq9" data-start="3300" data-end="3320">
<p data-start="3302" data-end="3320">easting e northing</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nubwin" data-start="3321" data-end="3354">
<p data-start="3323" data-end="3354">leitura básica da estrutura UTM</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3356" data-end="3359">
<h2 data-section-id="2v1jfl" data-start="3361" data-end="3399"><span role="text">8. <code data-start="3367" data-end="3399">aula03_08_fusos-utm-brasil.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="3400" data-end="3456">Eu manteria separada porque fica bem aplicada ao Brasil.</p>
<p data-start="3458" data-end="3503"><strong data-start="3458" data-end="3469">Visual:</strong> mapa do Brasil com fusos 18 a 26.</p>
<hr data-start="3505" data-end="3508">
<h2 data-section-id="1jbk6ic" data-start="3510" data-end="3561"><span role="text">9. <code data-start="3516" data-end="3561">aula03_09_checklist-referencia-espacial.png</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="3562" data-end="3594">Melhor manter separado no final.</p>
<p data-start="3596" data-end="3665"><strong data-start="3596" data-end="3607">Motivo:</strong> é uma peça de fechamento, quase um resumo visual da aula.</p>
<hr data-start="3667" data-end="3670">
<h1 data-section-id="1tohi5u" data-start="3672" data-end="3708">Se quiser deixar ainda mais enxuto</h1>
<p data-start="3710" data-end="3787">Dá para reduzir para <strong data-start="3731" data-end="3744">8 imagens</strong> se você juntar o SIRGAS ao bloco de datum.</p>
<p data-start="3789" data-end="3803">Ficaria assim:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="3805" data-end="4220"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>img/aula03_01_fluxo-referencia-espacial.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_02_superficies-referencia-datum-e-sirgas.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_03_coordenadas-geograficas-e-latitude-longitude.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_04_coordenadas-geograficas-e-projetadas.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_05_projecoes-cartograficas-tipos-e-propriedades.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_06_utm-fusos-e-estrutura.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_07_fusos-utm-brasil.png</span><br><span>img/aula03_08_checklist-referencia-espacial.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h2 data-section-id="2ol49n" data-start="4222" data-end="4238">Minha opinião</h2>
<p data-start="4239" data-end="4341">Eu prefiro a versão com <strong data-start="4263" data-end="4276">9 imagens</strong>, porque ela ainda está enxuta, mas não aperta demais o conteúdo.</p>
<hr data-start="4343" data-end="4346">
<h1 data-section-id="15nqs5" data-start="4348" data-end="4383"><span role="text">Como isso ficaria no <code data-start="4371" data-end="4383">index.html</code></span></h1>
<p data-start="4385" data-end="4393">Exemplo:</p>
