<h2 data-section-id="1j6tfmj" data-start="565" data-end="618"><span role="text">Se a imagem estiver na mesma pasta do <code data-start="606" data-end="618">index.html</code></span></h2>
<p data-start="619" data-end="657">Aí <strong data-start="622" data-end="637">não precisa</strong> do <code data-start="641" data-end="647">img/</code>. Ficaria:</p>
